	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type "=" followed by an expression (=20 inches in cm) or "napkin 20 inches in cm".

Enter copies the result, Cmd+Enter copies "expression = result", Alt+Enter copies the expression.

Needs the napkin command line tool. It is looked up in ~/.cargo/bin, /opt/homebrew/bin and /usr/local/bin; set the napkin_path workflow variable to use another location.</string>
